Feature: Every catalogued ATAK preference key
  Generated by scripts/generate-preference-key-scenarios.mjs from data/atak-preferences.json
  Source: ATAK Civilian Software User Manual · Settings

  As a TAK operator
  I need one Scenario per SharedPreferences key
  So that hideable, XML, and screen-navigation prefs cannot be dropped from Gherkin

  Background:
    Given the TAK application is running


  Scenario: setting 3DRendering
    # SUM: "The appearance of the Self-Marker can be customized by navigating to Additional Tools and Plugins > Settings > Display Preferences > My Location Color/Size."
    Given Settings is open on display_preferences.xml
    When the operator changes preference "3DRendering"
    Then ListView should persist preference "3DRendering"
    And DialogPanel should not invent a different SharedPreferences name
    And intent "com.atakmap.app.COMPONENTS_CREATED" should have registered the screen
    And a CoT type "a-f-G-U-C" self SA event should continue


